WEBVTT

00:01:59.907 --> 00:02:03.369
changes the effectiveness
of that vaccination,

00:02:03.369 --> 00:02:06.539
just as we know it does
with your annual flu shot.

00:02:07.331 --> 00:02:10.710
What we do know
for certain though is this:

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:15.339
your sleep health is intimately related
to your immune health.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:16.966
Said simply:

00:02:16.966 --> 00:02:20.052
sleep is a life support system.